{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; SURVIVE, DEFENSE, ESCAPE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome back to another exciting episode of the Oddinary Farm Show!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, the viewer, will look deeply into the tiny, feeble human mind as they struggle to survive on Earth(2).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together or alone, they must farm, capture animals, and use the island\u2019s resources to gather enough money to build a hot air balloon ~\u00a0<i>their only chance to escape</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware: it\u2019s not as easy as it sounds. We\u2019ve seeded organic, non-GMO Alien-brand Scrum across the island. These creatures will help test the peak <strong>sillyness\u00a0</strong>of our contestants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will they survive each night and make it through the great flood? Grab some human popcorn, sit back, relax, and find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It\u2019s SHOW TIME.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade-style Farming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animal Taming &amp; Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration &amp; Foraging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building &amp; Defense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Coop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally Generated Map</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3848990?t=1757636853","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3848990?t=1757636853","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848990/1689a0801cc42e8f770716c76f02e1aad32900d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757636853","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848990/1689a0801cc42e8f770716c76f02e1aad32900d2/capsul